WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.667
Rope at eye height; step back until your arms are straight and the cable is taut.

2
00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.333
Pull the rope to your forehead, hands apart, elbows high.

3
00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:05.000
Straighten your arms slowly without stepping forward.
